  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "440ce192-7aa7-4165-91d1-75446007808a",
    "name": "Daring Foods Retail Products API",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "description": {
      "content": "Daring Foods publishes daring.com on WordPress (WP Engine) with the core WordPress REST API enabled and anonymously readable. This document covers the site's custom `products` post type, which backs the retail product catalog at https://daring.com/products/ - Original Shredded and Diced Plant Chicken, the Plant Chicken Bowl line, Plant Chicken Wings, and the Cajun/Teriyaki/Original Pieces. At time of capture the collection held 14 published products (observed in the X-WP-Total response header). This is NOT a commerce, inventory or ordering API and Daring Foods operates no developer program - it is the content API behind the marketing site, captured for discovery purposes. Product attribute data (nutrition, ingredients, retail availability) is held in Advanced Custom Fields which this host does NOT expose over REST: the `acf` member is present but empty, so only title, slug, link, dates, featured image ID and SEO metadata are retrievable.\n\nContact Support:\n Name: Daring Foods",
      "type": "text/plain"
    }
  }
